s.openrice.com/QrbJ041SM01"},{"full":"https://static5.orstatic.com/userphoto2/photo/1V/1H94/0AIOU8FFF07B61D927B26Apx.jpg","time":"2022-07-07T00:06:44+08:00","caption":"呢個係最（正常）既，就真係一般既西蘭花牛肉，但都係賣相砌得好企理，唔會水汪汪，夠鑊氣，夠香口，牛肉大大塊唔會un 。好食。","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0G9WD01"},{"full":"https://static8.orstatic.com/userphoto2/photo/1V/1H94/0AIOU76A9214A7A08431B7px.jpg","time":"2022-07-07T00:06:44+08:00","caption":"賣相都好吸引，雖然係套餐加廿蚊追加，但真心ok，麻辣酸香都做到，比起一般餐廳幾十蚊得幾舊，雖然賣相一般，低呢個絕對抵食，個醬係較為杰身既，芝麻花生都夠香，唔似係","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0FvWD01"},{"full":"https://static7.orstatic.com/userphoto2/photo/1V/1H94/0AIOU6647D70519D92EDC2px.jpg","time":"2022-07-07T00:06:44+08:00","caption":"連擺盤都別出心裁，詢問職員，原來旁邊一條條既綠色拌碟係\"菜心葉\"切絲再\"炸\" 出嚟，呢個幾特別，又好睇又食得，心機之作。","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0FfWD01"},{"full":"https://static6.orstatic.com/userphoto2/photo/1V/1H94/0AIOU52AF4BC16F8CCD73Dpx.jpg","time":"2022-07-07T00:06:44+08:00","caption":"欖角密絲骨，賣相吸引，味道ok，甜甜哋，欖角又甘甘哋，好有心思既配搭，金沙骨肉質鬆脆","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0FPWD01"},{"full":"https://static5.orstatic.com/userphoto2/photo/1V/1H94/0AIOU4FBA93B505A46683Fpx.jpg","time":"2022-07-07T00:06:44+08:00","caption":"芝士汁夠濃夠香，篤住舊豆腐點落去，有啲似食緊芝士火鍋，有趣！","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0F9WD01"},{"full":"https://static8.orstatic.com/userphoto2/photo/1V/1H94/0AIOU30F64FDAAC0E3ED98px.jpg","time":"2022-07-07T00:06:44+08:00","caption":"芝士琵琶豆腐，中西合璧 本身以為係普通琵琶豆腐， 點知完全將印象中既琵琶豆腐顛倒。有點似芝士火鍋。","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0EvWD01"}],"food_total":49}